  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Smritivan Earthquake Memorial & Museum<br/>
    Bhujiyo Dungar, Bhuj, Gujarat<br/>
    Email: info@@smritivanmuseum.com
  </p>

  <p>Last updated: April 2026</p>

</main>

<!-- FOOTER -->
</main>
